## 📐 DETAILED IMPLEMENTATION PLAN

### **Step 1: Update Data Structure**

Add `priority` field to `KeyCapability` interface:

```typescript
// src/types/copilot-types.ts
export interface KeyCapability {
  title: string;
  priority?: 'primary' | 'advanced'; // NEW FIELD
  technical: CapabilityAspect | string;
  scientific: CapabilityAspect | string;
  business: CapabilityAspect | string;
  genomicUseCasesParagraph?: string;
}
```

Add `integratedCare` field to `CoPilotDetailContent`:

```typescript
export interface CoPilotDetailContent {
  // ... existing fields ...
  keyCapabilities: KeyCapability[];
  integratedCare?: KeyCapability; // NEW FIELD - Separate section
}
```

### **Step 2: Update Component to Handle Priorities**

Modify `TacticalCapabilityMatrix` to:
1. Filter `primary` capabilities for main tabs
2. Show `advanced` capabilities in collapsible section
3. Render `integratedCare` as separate prominent section

**Component Structure:**
```typescript
<TacticalCapabilityMatrix>
  {/* PRIMARY CAPABILITIES - Tabbed Interface */}
  <PrimaryCapabilitiesTabs capabilities={primaryCapabilities} />
  
  {/* ADVANCED FEATURES - Collapsible Section */}
  <AdvancedFeaturesSection capabilities={advancedCapabilities} />
  
  {/* INTEGRATED CARE - Separate Prominent Section */}
  {integratedCare && (
    <IntegratedCareSection capability={integratedCare} />
  )}
</TacticalCapabilityMatrix>
```

