## 📊 CAPABILITY PRIORITIZATION GUIDE

### **Primary Capabilities (Always Visible):**
- ✅ Core functionality of the co-pilot
- ✅ Most frequently used features
- ✅ Key differentiators
- ✅ Maximum 3-4 capabilities

### **Advanced Capabilities (Collapsed):**
- ✅ Secondary features
- ✅ Power-user features
- ✅ Nice-to-have enhancements
- ✅ Can be 1-3 capabilities

### **Integrated Care (Separate Section):**
- ✅ Always show (not hidden)
- ✅ Positioned prominently but at bottom
- ✅ Highlights integration value
- ✅ Single capability per co-pilot

